message: "Please cite this software and its accompanying pilot report when using the work. See RIGHTS.md for material-specific licence scope."
title: "Evaluating a Fly-Connectome Regulator for a Frozen Local LLM: A Controlled Pilot"
type: software
version: 0.1.0-rc3
authors:
  - family-names: Turek
    given-names: Krystian
    email: "krystian@connection-london.org"
abstract: "Controlled, underpowered local pilot with a frozen LLM, measured larval connectivity, matched graph controls and causal ablations. No convincing topology or persistence advantage was established. Includes an offline replay and saved-result analysis; connectivity and readouts excluded pending data licence clarification. See AUTHORSHIP.md for the owner's natural-language direction and Codex's implementation, execution, analysis and drafting roles."
keywords:
  - connectome
  - reservoir computing
  - language model evaluation
  - negative results
